class=3D"fa-primary"></path></g></svg>
      Conjuring Contest
    </h2> <div class=3D"text-left"><p class=3D"size-md margin-bottom-md">
    To celebrate the launch of the Icon Wizard<span class=3D"size-xs muted"=
 style=3D"vertical-align: 0.25em;">=E2=84=A2</span> 2.0, we're running the =
Conjuring Contest for the most creative, useful, and downright awesome icon=
s our community can conjure. Submit your creations to the Icon Wizard Galle=
ry between <strong>August 3, 2026</strong> and <strong>September 7, 2026</s=
trong>, and the Font Awesome team will pick our favorites. Winners will be =
announced on September 15, 2026. Win a free year of Font Awesome, plus glor=
y and a fortune in internet points.
  </p> <h2 id=3D"who-can-enter" class=3D"size-lg margin-top-lg">Who Can Ent=
er</h2> <p>
    The Conjuring Contest is open to anyone with an active <strong>Font Awe=
some</strong> subscription. Folks with free accounts can build and preview =
compositions in the Icon Wizard, but submitting to the gallery requires an =
active subscription.
  </p> <h2 id=3D"how-to-enter" class=3D"size-lg margin-top-lg">How to Enter=
</h2> <ol><li>Open the <a href=3D"https://fontawesome.com/icons/wizard" cla=
ss=3D"link">Icon Wizard</a>.</li> <li>Stack, blend, and combine Font Awesom=
e icons into a single custom creation.</li> <li>When you're happy with the =
result, open the <strong><svg data-prefix=3D"fas" data-icon=3D"share-nodes"=
 role=3D"img" viewBox=3D"0 0 512 512" aria-hidden=3D"true" class=3D"margin-=
right-3xs svg-inline--fa fa-share-nodes"><path fill=3D"currentColor" d=3D"M=
384 192c53 0 96-43 96-96s-43-96-96-96-96 43-96 96c0 5.4 .5 10.8 1.3 16L159.=
6 184.1c-16.9-15-39.2-24.1-63.6-24.1-53 0-96 43-96 96s43 96 96 96c24.4 0 46=
.6-9.1 63.6-24.1L289.3 400c-.9 5.2-1.3 10.5-1.3 16 0 53 43 96 96 96s96-43 9=
6-96-43-96-96-96c-24.4 0-46.6 9.1-63.6 24.1L190.7 272c.9-5.2 1.3-10.5 1.3-1=
6s-.5-10.8-1.3-16l129.7-72.1c16.9 15 39.2 24.1 63.6 24.1z" class=3D""></pat=
h></svg>Share</strong> screen.</li> <li>In the Conjuring Contest panel, cli=
ck <strong><svg data-prefix=3D"fas" data-icon=3D"sparkles" role=3D"img" vie=
wBox=3D"0 0 576 512" aria-hidden=3D"true" class=3D"margin-right-3xs svg-inl=
ine--fa fa-sparkles"><path fill=3D"currentColor" d=3D"M391.5 53.2c-4.5 1.7-=
7.5 6-7.5 10.8s3 9.1 7.5 10.8L448 96 469.2 152.5c1.7 4.5 6 7.5 10.8 7.5s9.1=
-3 10.8-7.5L512 96 568.5 74.8c4.5-1.7 7.5-6 7.5-10.8s-3-9.1-7.5-10.8L512 32=
 490.8-24.5c-1.7-4.5-6-7.5-10.8-7.5s-9.1 3-10.8 7.5L448 32 391.5 53.2zm-185=
 20.1c-2.6-5.7-8.3-9.3-14.5-9.3s-11.9 3.6-14.5 9.3l-53.1 115-115 53.1C3.6 2=
44.1 0 249.8 0 256s3.6 11.9 9.3 14.5l115 53.1 53.1 115c2.6 5.7 8.3 9.3 14.5=
 9.3s11.9-3.6 14.5-9.3l53.1-115 115-53.1c5.7-2.6 9.3-8.3 9.3-14.5s-3.6-11.9=
-9.3-14.5l-115-53.1-53.1-115zM416 416l-56.5 21.2c-4.5 1.7-7.5 6-7.5 10.8s3 =
9.1 7.5 10.8L416 480 437.2 536.5c1.7 4.5 6 7.5 10.8 7.5s9.1-3 10.8-7.5L480 =
480 536.5 458.8c4.5-1.7 7.5-6 7.5-10.8s-3-9.1-7.5-10.8L480 416 458.8 359.5c=
-1.7-4.5-6-7.5-10.8-7.5s-9.1 3-10.8 7.5L416 416z" class=3D""></path></svg>S=
ubmit to Gallery</strong>.</li></ol> <p>
    Each subscribed account can submit up to <strong>5 icons</strong> durin=
g the contest cycle.
    Every submission is reviewed by the Font Awesome team before it appears=
 in the gallery.
  </p> <h2 id=3D"categories" class=3D"size-lg margin-top-lg">Categories</h2=
> <p>Winners are selected from these categories, and we may add more at our=
 discretion.</p> <ul><li><strong>Most Useful</strong>: an icon you can actu=
ally imagine using in a real project.
    </li> <li><strong>Most Creative</strong>: pure wow factor, clever layer=
 combinations.
    </li> <li><strong>Best Remix</strong>: best transformation of existing =
Font Awesome icons into something new.
    </li> <li><strong>Funniest Icon</strong>: the icon that makes the team =
laugh out loud.
    </li></ul> <h2 id=3D"prizes" class=3D"size-lg margin-top-lg">Prizes</h2=
> <p>
    Winners receive a free year of Font Awesome (Starter or Solo), or an ac=
count credit of equal value if you already have an active subscription, plu=
s swag and more.
    All approved icons will be featured in the <a href=3D"https://fontaweso=
me.com/icons/gallery" class=3D"link">Icon Wizard Gallery</a>.
  </p> <h2 id=3D"rules" class=3D"size-lg margin-top-lg">Rules and Restricti=
ons</h2> <h3 class=3D"size-md margin-top-md">1. Eligibility</h3> <ul><li>Yo=
u must be at least 18 years old, or 13+ with permission from a parent or le=
gal guardian.</li> <li>You need a Font Awesome account in good standing wit=
h an active subscription to enter.</li> <li>Employees, contractors, and the=
ir immediate family members of Fonticons, Inc. are not eligible to win priz=
es.</li> <li>The Contest is void where prohibited or restricted by law.</li=
></ul> <h3 class=3D"size-md margin-top-md">2. Contest Period</h3> <ul><li>T=
he Contest opens August 3, 2026 and closes September 7, 2026. Submissions r=
eceived outside this window won't be considered.</li></ul> <h3 class=3D"siz=
e-md margin-top-md">3. Entry Requirements</h3> <ul><li>Submissions must be =
built entirely within the Icon Wizard using Font Awesome icons.</li> <li>Ea=
ch submission must be your own work. Don't submit icons built by someone el=
se.</li> <li>You may submit up to <strong>5 entries</strong>.</li></ul> <h3=
 class=3D"size-md margin-top-md">4. Originality and Content</h3> <ul><li>Su=
bmissions must be original creations. Recognizable brand logos, trademarks,=
 copyrighted characters, and third-party icon-set work are not eligible.</l=
i> <li>No offensive, discriminatory, or illegal content. We reserve the rig=
ht to reject anything that doesn't fit the spirit of the gallery.</li> <li>=
By entering, you represent that your submission is your original work and d=
oesn't infringe anyone's copyright, trademark, privacy, or other rights. Yo=
u agree to indemnify and hold Font Awesome harmless from any claim arising =
from a breach of that representation.</li></ul> <h3 class=3D"size-md margin=
-top-md">5. Judging and Winner Selection</h3> <ul><li>Entries will be evalu=
ated by the Font Awesome team on creativity, technical execution, and fit w=
ith the gallery. Judges' decisions are final.</li></ul> <h3 class=3D"size-m=
d margin-top-md">6. Prizes</h3> <ul><li>Winners receive a free year of Font=
 Awesome (Starter or Solo), or an account credit of equal value if you alre=
ady have an active subscription.</li> <li>One prize per person across all c=
ategories.</li> <li>Prizes are non-transferable. No cash substitution, thou=
gh we may substitute a prize of equal or greater value if necessary.</li> <=
li>Winners are responsible for any taxes that apply to their prize.</li> <l=
i>Winners under 18 must have a parent or legal guardian accept the prize on=
 their behalf.</li></ul> <h3 class=3D"size-md margin-top-md">7. Moderation<=
/h3> <ul><li>Every submission is reviewed by the Font Awesome team before i=
t appears in the gallery. During the Contest, we aim to review entries with=
in 3 business days. We may remove any submission at our discretion if it vi=
olates these guidelines.</li></ul> <h3 class=3D"size-md margin-top-md">8. I=
ntellectual Property and Licensing</h3> <ul><li>By entering, you grant Font=
 Awesome a non-exclusive, worldwide, perpetual, royalty-free license to dis=
play, reproduce, and adapt your icon in the gallery, in marketing materials=
, and on social media, with attribution where provided. This license includ=
es the right to crop, resize, or reformat your icon for those uses.</li> <l=
i>Because every submission is built from Font Awesome's own icons, it's pos=
sible something you create will resemble an icon we're already working on, =
or one we decide to add to the official library later. By entering, you agr=
ee that Font Awesome is free to develop and release similar or identical ic=
ons and icon/modifier combinations, and that assembling a combination in th=
e Icon Wizard gives you no ownership interest in Font Awesome's underlying =
icon library. You waive any claim against Font Awesome arising from our cre=
ation, use, or distribution of such icons.</li></ul> <h3 class=3D"size-md m=
argin-top-md">9. Your Information</h3> <ul><li>Providing a social handle is=
 optional. If you include one, we'll display it alongside your creation to =
credit you when it appears in the gallery or in Font Awesome marketing, for=
 as long as your creation is featured.</li> <li>If you win, we'll email the=
 address on your Font Awesome account to notify you.</li> <li>We handle thi=
s information in accordance with our <a href=3D"https://fontawesome.com/pri=
vacy" class=3D"link">Privacy Policy</a>, which explains how to access or de=
lete your data.</li></ul> <h3 class=3D"size-md margin-top-md">10. General T=
erms</h3> <ul><li>We may modify, suspend, or cancel the Contest at any time=
 if fraud, technical failure, or any factor beyond our control compromises =
its fairness or integrity.</li> <li>We may disqualify any entrant who tampe=
rs with the Contest, uses automation or multiple accounts, or otherwise vio=
lates these rules.</li> <li>If any provision of these rules is found unenfo=
rceable, the rest remain in effect.</li></ul> <h2 id=3D"questions" class=3D=
"size-lg margin-top-lg">Questions?</h2> <p>
    For anything contest-related, reach the Font Awesome team at <a href=3D=
"mailto:hello@fontawesome.com" class=3D"link">hello@fontawesome.com</a>.
  </p></div> <div class=3D"text-center margin-top-xl"><a href=3D"https://fo=
ntawesome.com/icons/gallery/contest" class=3D"link" style=3D"--link-color: =
var(--fa-navy); --link-hover-color: var(--fa-dk-blue);">
        Open the Full Contest Page
      </a></div> <!----> <button type=3D"button" aria-label=3D"Close" data-=
